SameDevice Test
===============

Test 1: Duplicate locks on the same object report the same device
  PASS: Duplicate locks share a device

Test 2: Different objects on the same volume report the same device
  PASS: Same volume shares a device

Test 3: Locks on different devices report DOSFALSE
  PASS: Different devices compare false

Test 4: NULL first lock returns DOSFALSE
  PASS: NULL first lock rejected

Test 5: NULL second lock returns DOSFALSE
  PASS: NULL second lock rejected

Failed: 0
